CHECK:COMPARISON_TO_NULL: Comparison to NULL could be written "!parent_cgroup"
#131: FILE: security/device_cgroup.c:184:
+	if (parent_cgroup == NULL)

Comparisons to NULL in the form (foo == NULL) or (foo != NULL)
